📌 Repository Description
SystemAudit-Probe is a comprehensive security assessment utility designed for penetration testers, red-team operators, and security researchers. It performs deep system reconnaissance, detects exposed credentials in browser databases, identifies sensitive configuration files, and validates the security posture of Windows environments during authorized testing engagements. This tool is part of an enterprise-grade security auditing suite and is intended exclusively for use in controlled, legally authorized environments.

